      },
      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/2480-tab-bridge-width\n\nMain (#2460) moved the contour level loop into emit_band, where lead_notes is a &mut parameter; the PR's tabs_fill_note call now passes it as is (say(lead_notes, n)), so the tab window rule covers the whole-model bands too. The example project takes main's format version and drill note and keeps the PR's contour cache, which a WRITE_GOLDEN regeneration reproduces.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
